@echo off\necho SafeTrak Firestore Rules Deployment\necho.\necho This publishes firestore.rules to the existing safetrack-47 project.\necho.\ncall npx firebase-tools use safetrack-47\nif errorlevel 1 goto login\ncall npx firebase-tools deploy --only firestore:rules --project safetrack-47\nif errorlevel 1 goto end\necho.\necho Firestore rules deployed successfully.\ngoto end\n:login\necho Firebase authentication/project selection is required.\ncall npx firebase-tools login\ncall npx firebase-tools use safetrack-47\ncall npx firebase-tools deploy --only firestore:rules --project safetrack-47\n:end\npause\n